  registered claim (REFEREE_ATTACKS.md 2.7): median residual 11.5%, 80th pct 22%
  [canonical] a0 = 9.3623e-11
      (b) Table-1 Vflat,  M/L 0.5/0.7 : n=135 median|res|=  5.0%  80th=  9.7%  rms=0.0899 dex
