  [alt] a0 = 1.1279e-10
      (b) Table-1 Vflat,  M/L 0.5/0.7 : n=135 median|res|=  4.3%  80th=  9.0%  rms=0.0862 dex
      (a) curve-median V, M/L 0.5/0.7 : n=171 median|res|=  5.0%  80th= 10.7%  rms=0.1046 dex
  RE-AUDIT READING: the registered 11.5%/22% is NOT reproduced by the committed
  pipeline (G033's own bundle artifact, read directly: median 5.04%, 80th 9.17%
  canonical; this run: 5.0-5.6% / 9.4-11.6% across the three readings).  The
  registered claim's provenance predates the committed bundle and likely
  conflated the EB-E3 register (median M_pred/M_phot = 1.15).  THE
  DECOMPOSITION FRONTS THE COMMITTED NUMBER: observed BTFR scatter ~ 5-6%
  median |res|, ~ 9-12% 80th pct, rms ~ 0.09-0.11 dex in v (rms ~ 0.36-0.44
  dex in M_b) on the real data, both footings, three readings.

